<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Student Financial Aid Application</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 10pt; }
  .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid black; padding-bottom: 2px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt; }
  th { background-color: #f0f0f0; }
  .checkbox-group label { font-weight: normal; margin-right: 15px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">YESHIVA UNIVERSITY</div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">500 WEST 185TH STREET ROOM 121</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">NEW YORK, NY 10033-3201</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Phone: {{ contact_phone }} - Fax: {{ contact_fax }}</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Email: {{ contact_email }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">OFFICE OF STUDENT AID</h2>
    <h1 class="header-title">Graduate International</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Student Financial Aid Application</h2>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Please complete all questions in ink and return this form to the address above along with copies of your, your spouse's and your parents' bank statements and proof of income documents. Statements and documents should be in English. Please fill out this form only if you are not a U.S. citizen or eligible non-citizen. Students who hold dual citizenship with the U.S. and another country must file a FAFSA.</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">1. Name</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ full_name }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">Family</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ family_name }}</div>
      <div class="label">First</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ first_name }}</div>
      <div class="label">Middle</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ middle_name }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">2. Student Identification Number (YUID#)</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ student_id_number }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">3. Date of Birth</div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;"><div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ dob_month }}</div></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;"><div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ dob_day }}</div></div>
        <div style="flex: 1;"><div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ dob_year }}</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">4. Place of Birth</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ place_of_birth }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">5. Citizen of</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ citizenship }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">6. Email:</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ email_address }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">7. Permanent Address</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ permanent_address }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">8. Phone Number</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ phone_number }}</div>
      <div class="label" style="margin-top: 5px;">including country code</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">9. Phone Number in the US</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ us_phone_number }}</div>
      <div class="label" style="margin-top: 5px;">if available</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">10. Fax Number</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ fax_number }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">11. Expected Visa Type:</div>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Academic (F-1)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Diplomatic or Official (A or G)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Other</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="label">12. Are you applying as:</div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <label><input type="checkbox"> a first time student at YU?</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> a transfer student from another college or university?</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> a returning student?</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="label">13. If you are a transfer or first time student, when do you expect to begin your studies at YU?</div>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ expected_start_date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">14. Marital Status:</div>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="marital_status" value="single"> Single</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="marital_status" value="married"> Married</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">Semester and year</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ semester_year }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">15. Family Information</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Name and age of family member</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Relationship to you</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Name of educational institution currently attending (if applicable)</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Total tuition - US$ (including room & board and fees) if applicable</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Amount your parent contributed - US$</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in family_members %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].name_age">{{ item.name_age }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].relationship">{{ item.relationship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].institution">{{ item.institution }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].tuition_amount">{{ item.tuition_amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].parent_contribution">{{ item.parent_contribution }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 class="section-title">Financial Information</h2>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">16. What is the current exchange rate of your country's currency to the US Dollar (US\$)?</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ exchange_rate }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <div class="label"></div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">=$1</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">17. Please list family income (before taxes) from the following sources during the last complete calendar year.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Your Employment</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">US\$</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Pensions/Annuities</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">US\$</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Investments/Dividends</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">US\$</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Your Spouse's Employment</td>
        <td><span data-field="income.spouse_employment_us$">{{ income.spouse_employment_us$ }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Real Estate Holdings</td>
        <td><span data-field="income.real_estate_holdings_us$">{{ income.real_estate_holdings_us$ }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other (please explain)</td>
        <td><span data-field="income.other_us$">{{ income.other_us$ }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">18. Do you own your home?</div>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes (if yes, please complete a-c below)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">b) Amount still owed on purchase price US\$</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ amount_owed_on_purchase }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">a) Original purchase price US\$</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ original_purchase_price }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">c) Current market value US\$</div>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;">{{ current_market_value }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">19. Please list the current value of the following:</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 50%;">Item</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Value US\$</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>a) Real Estate (other than your primary residence)</td>
        <td><span data-field="asset_value.real_estate">{{ asset_value.real_estate }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>b) Investments (stocks, bonds, certificates of deposit, etc.)</td>
        <td><span data-field="asset_value.investments">{{ asset_value.investments }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>c) Savings (cash)</td>
        <td><span data-field="asset_value.savings">{{ asset_value.savings }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="label">20. Please list the amount of annual support toward your education expected from the following sources.</div>
      <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">Parents</div>
        <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">Relatives/Other Family</div>
        <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">Other (please explain)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">US\$</div>
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">US\$</div>
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 33%;">US\$</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">21. By signing below you certify that the information provided on this application is accurate and true. I understand that Yeshiva University may attempt to obtain documentation for verification.</p>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 60px;">
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="label">Student's Signature</div>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group" style="width: 50%;">
        <div class="label">Date</div>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>